CONN 0
>>> >> >> >
>>> >> >> > which enables the output of the pin 0x0f, then connects to the =
first
>>> >> >> > DAC (=3D 0x10). =C2=A0Similarly,
>>> >> >> >
>>> >> >> > =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0# hda-verb /dev/snd/hwC0D0 0x14 SET_=
